# CLINOVYR.COM — Cursor Rules
# AI Business Consulting | Granite Bay, CA

## Project Overview
This is the marketing website for Clinovyr, an AI consulting firm serving small and mid-size businesses in the Roseville/Granite Bay, California area. The brand is sophisticated, intelligent, and results-focused — not flashy or startup-generic.

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 15 App Router (TypeScript)
- Tailwind CSS with custom design tokens
- Framer Motion for animations
- Resend for contact form emails
- Deployed on Cloudflare Workers (OpenNext)

## Design System
### Colors (define in tailwind.config.ts)
- ink: #0d0f12 (near-black, primary text/backgrounds)
- paper: #f5f2ed (warm off-white, light backgrounds)  
- cream: #ede9e2 (secondary warm background)
- accent: #1a6b5a (deep teal — primary brand color)
- accent-light: #2d9e88 (lighter teal for hovers/highlights)
- gold: #c49a3c (warm gold — secondary accent, use sparingly)
- muted: #7a7468 (warm gray for secondary text)
- rule: #d8d3ca (subtle divider color)

### Typography
- Display/Headings: Cormorant Garamond (serif, elegant, editorial)
- Body: Instrument Sans (clean, readable)
- Mono/Labels: DM Mono (technical labels, pricing, tags)

### Design Principles
- Sophisticated, NOT corporate generic
- Dark sections contrast with warm paper/cream sections
- Generous whitespace — never cluttered
- Animations: subtle fade-ins and slide-ups, never flashy
- Mobile-first responsive

## Code Standards
- Always use TypeScript, never plain JS
- Named exports for all components (never default export for components)
- File naming: kebab-case for files, PascalCase for component names
- Server Components by default; only use "use client" when needed for interactivity
- Use the cn() utility for conditional Tailwind classes
- Never use inline styles — Tailwind classes only
- Use semantic HTML (section, article, nav, main, header, footer)
- Every page must be accessible: proper heading hierarchy, aria labels, keyboard nav

## File Structure
src/
  app/          → Next.js App Router pages
  components/   → Reusable UI components
    ui/         → Primitive components (Button, Badge, etc.)
    sections/   → Page sections (Hero, Services, etc.)
    layout/     → Header, Footer, Navigation
  lib/          → Utilities, constants, types
  styles/       → Global CSS

## Content — Clinovyr Brand
- Company: Clinovyr (clinovyr.com)
- Location: Granite Bay / Roseville, California
- Tagline: "Intelligence, Applied."
- Mission: Help local Placer County businesses implement AI to save time, reduce costs, and grow
- Target clients: Medical practices, real estate firms, law firms, construction companies, med spas, specialty retail
- Services: AI Readiness Assessment, Workflow Automation, AI Operations Retainer, Workshops, AI Strategy, Industry Playbooks

## Do Not
- Do not use purple gradients or generic "AI startup" aesthetics
- Do not use Arial, Inter, or Roboto as primary fonts
- Do not add unnecessary npm packages without asking
- Do not use useEffect for data fetching — use Server Components
- Do not add placeholder/lorem ipsum text — use real Clinovyr content
